
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>AI Health Assistant | VitaNex AI</title>
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 20px;
      min-height: 100vh;
      background: #07151b;
      color: #edfdfb;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    }
    main {
      max-width: 760px;
      margin: auto;
    }
    header {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
    a { color: #6be5d1; }
    #messages {
      height: 60vh;
      min-height: 300px;
      overflow-y: auto;
      margin: 20px 0;
      padding: 18px;
      border: 1px solid #285158;
      border-radius: 16px;
      background: #0c1f26;
    }
    .message {
      padding: 12px 14px;
      margin: 10px 0;
      border-radius: 12px;
      line-height: 1.5;
      white-space: pre-wrap;
      overflow-wrap: anywhere;
    }
    .user { background: #16443f; margin-left: 12%; }
    .assistant { background: #142e38; margin-right: 12%; }
    form { display: flex; gap: 10px; }
    input {
      flex: 1;
      min-width: 0;
      padding: 14px;
      color: white;
      background: #0c1f26;
      border: 1px solid #34555b;
      border-radius: 10px;
    }
    button {
      padding: 12px 16px;
      border: 0;
      border-radius: 10px;
      background: #6be5d1;
      color: #071b1c;
      font-weight: bold;
      cursor: pointer;
    }
    button:disabled { opacity: .6; }
    #status { color: #a5c2c5; min-height: 22px; }
    .note { color: #a5c2c5; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.5; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main>
    <header>
      <h2>💚 VitaNex AI Assistant</h2>
      <a href="./index.html">Back to Home</a>
    </header>

    <p class="note">
      Health information is general guidance, not a medical diagnosis.
      Avoid entering passwords or highly sensitive medical information.
    </p>

    <div id="messages" aria-live="polite"></div>
    <p id="status" role="status"></p>

    <form id="chatForm">
      <input id="chatInput" maxlength="5000"
             placeholder="Ask a health question..." required>
      <button id="sendButton" type="submit">Send</button>
    </form>
  </main>

  <script type="module" src="./chat.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
